TASK-132.15 runtime harness: installs the API Explorer into an isolated profile; attaches a parked tab (page) and the selected tab (worker), Page.enable on both; Runtime.evaluate on both, Claude's return retry; alert and confirm on both answered by the extension (no sheet expected); frameNavigated and getFrameTree's loaderId across a navigation; an unattached tab's confirm shows Detour's sheet; a pending dialog released by detach. Temporary, never committed to Detour/.

    git apply docs/harness/task132.15-harness.patch && xcodegen generate && build

    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify13215-<n> DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR=$OUT DETOUR_API_EXPLORER=$PWD/TestExtensions/api-explorer .derived/.../Detour

    # "SHOOT <name> <windowNumber>" lines in $OUT/verify.log cue screencapture -l; "SHEET" lines report window.attachedSheet; ends with "done".

